It is Saturday morning.
I wake up early, and I feel really well again.
The mild medicine has worked perfectly.
My eyes are clear, and they do not itch at all.
I do not have a headache, and my throat does not hurt anymore.
I get out of bed and open the window to the mild spring air.
It is lovely to be able to breathe without problems.
I go out into the kitchen to make a proper breakfast.
I eat bread with cheese and drink a large cup of hot coffee.
The sun is shining, so I think that I ought to go for a walk in the park.
I put on my spring jacket and go down to the street.
The trees are completely green now, and many people are enjoying the weather.
It is really boring to feel unwell when it is finally spring.
But today my legs feel strong, and I have my energy back.
I take a slow walk around the small lake in the park.
Fortunately I am completely healthy now, and I am ready to enjoy the weekend.
